  "homeSectionWelcomeTitle": "Welcome!",
  "homeSectionWelcomeText": "Situated in the Languedoc-Roussillon / Occitanie ( department Aude ), at 1 hour far from Mediterranean Sea and 1 hour far from Pyrenees mountains, the Domaine de Mestrugue was originally a farm built in the 17th century. The farm lies just outside the village of Montréal and is surrounded by 76 hectares of land with fantastic views on the Malepère hills, forest, grass and sunflower fields. Around the house are fig-, olive-, - cherry- and palm trees. Also the mimosa and lavender form part of this mediterranean landscape.",
