  "homeSectionCottagesColumn2Attribute4": "<i class='fas fa-dog'></i> No pets",
  "homeSectionCottagesColumn2Description": "Mimosa is a cottage of charm with character, very cozy self catering fully equipped with 1 bathroom. Mimosa has all the facilities to make your stay as comfortable as possible. The interior is stylish and the typical French features give it harmony. The wooden stair and the huge wooden beams that support the ceiling and the oiled wooden floors give the house its character. There are two privative terraces.",
