  "homeSectionCottagesColumn3Caption": "250$ / per night",
  "homeSectionCottagesColumn3Description": "On a hot summers day you can swim in our heated pool and enjoy the stunning views from the terrace overlooking the Malepère hills. If the sun is getting a bit too warm, come and sit under the shelter of the poolhouse. Inside you will find a bar where you can enjoy refreshing drinks.",
