  "poolSectionWelcomeTitle": "{poolHeroTitle}",
  "poolSectionWelcomeText": "During a hot summer day you can swim in our heated pool and enjoy the stunning views from the terrace overlooking the Malepère hills. The pool area is protected with a fence which doesn’t allow the youngest to come in without an adult. If the sun is getting a bit too warm, come and sit under the shelter of the pool house. It is also fully equipped with fridge with freezer, heating plates, dishwasher, coffee machine and all the necessary for having a light meal. On the side of the pool house, you will find a barbecue and a sink. Everything is here to wait for marvelous sunsets and really nice star-filled skies. Toilets are also in the place.",
  "poolSectionWelcomeButtonPrimary": "Learn More",

